{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Slim-only version matrix for the e2e-slim suite. NOT symlinked (unlike",
    "agents.lock.json), so the shared lock and the full tests/e2e suite are",
    "untouched. Each entry is an EXTRA historical, in-range (blessed) sample —",
    "the newest/blessed version per harness is the lock pin and is NOT duplicated",
    "here (build.rs adds the lock pin as its own cell). Every sample is below its",
    "adapter's `verified_before` ceiling, so the default matrix has no expected",
    "skips. Above-ceiling / calendar-current builds are deliberately excluded.",
    "`integrity` mirrors the lock's shape (pulled from npm dist metadata when",
    "authoring); `profile` documents the adapter VersionInterval each sample maps",
    "to. `arguments` is the per-cell launch argv (the element mentioning",
    "BLUE_CERT_OK is swapped for the tool-forcing prompt at cert time)."
  ],
